nadventurer = (a highly detailed and immersive ([fantasyLoc] scene) The fantasy scene is of {a} ({{lawful|neutral|chaotic} {good|evil} ^3|{lawful|true|chaotic} neutral}) {low|high|bronze|silver|A|C|S|F} rank member of the adventurer’s guild, they are obviously {a} ([fantasyClass]) with corresponding [textures] themed equipment and interesting accessories and ornamentations that are gritty from battle. (they are wearing visible footware typical to their outfit.) They are looking at and interacting with their surroundings in typical ways. their gear, outfit, and accessories are extremely typical of their class and are not new and clean. parts of their outfit are dingy and mildly stained, roughly scuffed and unevenly faded. the shoes have seen use. The sky indicates it is {a bright day|a dark night|pitch black midnight|dusk with a beautiful sunset|dawn with a gorgeous sunrise|the golden hour|{1-12} {AM|PM}}. )
nActress = a (full body view) of a pretty thing with the exact same facial structure as [Actress = actresses.selectOne]. The exact same chin and brow ridge as [Actress]. The exact same jaw and cheekbones as [Actress]. The exact same nose and mouth as [Actress]. The exact same forehead and face ratios as [Actress]. The exact same racial features and eyebrows as [Actress]. The exact same eye shape and eye color as [Actress]. The exact same skin type and skin tone as [Actress]. The exact same hair and hair color as [Actress]. In one of her starring roles. She is [t = poseOption, t.value||t] and [expression]. She is in a typical location and She is actively interacting with her surroundings in typical ways and she is active and looking at something off frame. (Her appropriate footwear are visible)
WeightTheme = [input.themeWeight]
WeightArt = [input.artWeight]
fantasyArt
  A lush, 1980s pulp fantasy oil painting with saturated colors and dramatic chiaroscuro lighting. The art style features the heavy brushwork and airbrushed highlights typical of 80s fantasy book covers, with deep shadows, flickering torchlight casting long silhouettes against the damp walls, and a rich, textured atmosphere of grit and glamour.
  A grainy, tactile 1980s fantasy art sketch on aged, yellowed parchment. The composition is dynamic and off-balance. The art style features heavy graphite hatching, smudged charcoal shadows, and ink washes. Soft, dusty shafts of light, illuminating floating dust motes and the rough texture of the paper. The aesthetic is evocative of vintage sword-and-sorcery paperback covers, with raw, expressive line work and a warm, sepia-toned palette.
  A vintage 1980s Dungeons and Dragons manual illustration with heavy ink line-work and saturated gouache coloring. High-angle dramatic composition, stark chiaroscuro lighting, grainy parchment texture, overly dramatic character acting.
  A stylized 1980s Dungeons and Dragons fantasy illustration with a dramatic, hand-painted aesthetic and saturated colors. High-contrast lighting with dramatic shadows, heavy grain, and the distinct texture of vintage gouache and ink on aged parchment. Low angle shot to emphasize exaggerated proportions.
  A vintage fantasy illustration in the style of 1970s pulp fantasy art, featuring a grainy, hand-painted texture with rich acrylic layering. rendered with an extreme depth of field as if captured by a wide-angle action lens. The lighting is a moody mix of flickering amber candlelight and deep indigo shadows.
  A vintage 1950s pulp science fiction magazine cover painting in gouache. Dramatic overhead spotlighting casts deep noir-style shadows with bold primary reds and yellows. The composition is an extreme perspective, looking down from a high angle. Heavy paint brushstrokes and a visible print dot grain texture evoke a mid-century printing press. High contrast, action-packed tension in a quiet moment, with a retro typography feel surrounding the frame. --ar 4:5
  vintage 1950s pulp science fiction magazine cover. dramatic overhead spotlighting, deep noir-style shadows, bold primary reds and yellows, gouache painting texture, heavy paint brushstrokes, slight print dot grain, high contrast, retro typography feeling, action-packed composition, extreme perspective, highly detailed, sharp focus, masterpiece, --ar 4:5
  A 1960s psychedelic fantasy illustration with a gritty, surrealist double-exposure effect. rendered in a hallucinatory dreamscape of intense electric colors and soft airbrush gradients. visceral, high-contrast composition. The aesthetic is that of a vintage print on grainy paper, featuring vivid saturation and sharp focus amidst a swirling, psychedelic atmosphere of deep purples, electric greens, and neon oranges. The lighting is moody and atmospheric, highlighting the tactile textures. --ar 4:5
  A 1960s psychedelic fantasy illustration. The color palette is dominated by intense electric colors, utilizing a surrealist double-exposure effect and soft airbrush gradients. The image has a tactile, grainy paper texture characteristic of vintage print, depicting a hallucinatory dreamscape with sharp focus. High contrast, vivid saturation, surreal composition. --ar 4:5
  A high-contrast 1890s Golden Age illustration on aged, textured parchment. The scene is rendered with precise pen-and-ink linework and a soft sepia watercolor wash. The entire composition is framed by an elaborate Art Nouveau border with organic floral motifs. The atmosphere is one of romantic medieval mysticism. 
