  photography with emotional storytelling. Intimate at golden hour, evening sun creating backlight with lens flare. Shot from side angle with 35mm lens. Lighting: golden hour backlight creating halo effect fill flash subtlety revealing facial expressions. Realistic fabric textures on attire, natural skin tones with emotional expressions. Genuine emotional moment, natural setting, timeless quality. Style: documentary storytelling photography, natural lighting, emotional storytelling. --style raw
  Hyper-realistic portrait photography. Shot with 85mm f/1.8 lens at f/2.8, shallow depth of field with eyes in sharp focus. Color grading: natural skin tones with slight warmth, Kodak Portra 400 film simulation. Classic portrait framing with slight negative space on {left|right}. --style raw ^5
  Cinematic landscape photography. Shot from low angle with 24mm wide-angle lens, deep depth of field. Style: National Geographic documentary photography, photorealistic, 8K resolution. --style raw
  Street photography with cinematic quality. Shot from across street with 85mm lens. Lighting: mixed sources. Atmospheric: light fog creating depth, motion blur. Style: documentary street photography, cinematic mood, realistic urban atmosphere. --style raw
  shot on Kodak Portra 400, natural grain, organic colors Canon 5D Mark IV, 24-70mm at 35mm, golden hour, shallow depth of field
  Sports action photography. lights creating dramatic shadows. Shot from low angle perspective with 70-200mm telephoto lens at 1/1000s shutter speed, freezing motion while showing slight motion blur. Style: professional sports photography, action freeze, realistic athletic details. --style raw
  shot on Kodak Portra 400, natural grain, organic colors Shot on Hasselblad X2D, 80mm lens, f/2.8, natural lighting
  Fashion editorial photography. Shot from low angle with 50mm lens at f/4. Lighting: dramatic chiaroscuro with strong contrast between light and shadow. Style: high-fashion editorial, dramatic lighting, realistic textures, cinematic quality. --style raw
  Commercial product photography. Shot from overhead perspective with macro lens, Lighting: professional studio setup with softbox creating soft shadows. Style: luxury product photography, clean commercial aesthetic, realistic materials and lighting. --style raw
